<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Schlaubetal-Wanderweg: Müllrose–Wirchensee — Schlaubetal-Wanderweg: Müllrose–Wirchensee</name><desc>Follow the blue S route from Müllrose Markt along the Großer Müllroser See and Schlaube through Ragower Mühle, Kupferhammer, Siehdichum and Bremsdorfer Mühle, then continue past Kieselwitzer Mühle and the Schlaube canyon to Wirchensee and Schlaubemühle. Arrange transport from the far end before setting out.

